The descriptor tables (descriptor_cache*.csv, panel*.csv, inchikeys.csv), the
colorimetric input tables (deltaE/), the collected source records (sources/),
the generated outputs (outputs/), the manuscript sources and figures
(paper_acs/, submission/) and the documentation (README.md) are licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially,
