================================================================================
MATERIAL THAT IS NOT OURS TO LICENSE
================================================================================

Two classes of file in this deposit were produced elsewhere, and this licence
does not extend to them.

1. sources/compiled_aegls_27jul2018.pdf is a United States Environmental
   Protection Agency document, reproduced here unmodified because the parse of
   it is the primary source for every toxicity value in the manuscript. It
   carries whatever terms the agency applies to it.

2. The colorimetric Delta E_00 tables under deltaE/ were measured and published
   in three earlier studies, cited in the manuscript, and are reproduced here
   as the input this reanalysis consumes. The measurements are those studies';
   the reanalysis is ours.

The regulatory values parsed into sources/registers_20261106.csv and
sources/designations_20261106.csv are facts taken from government documents,
with the source URL recorded for each row. The compilation is ours; the
underlying values are not copyrightable.
